[l_english.STATE_LORE_804]
After the fall of the Southern Equestria Dynasty, Anugypt fell into endless chaos and conflict. The ponies living here witnessed golden cities rising in the desert; they also saw them collapse within a century due to uprisings and rebellions; the rebels and their rulers turned into a handful of sand in the desert; the survivors followed the ripples of the dunes in search of new oases until they were erased by the wind or erected high cities for the next generation. In the wars between the city-states of Anugypt, there was a beautiful and ambitious pegasus who was once the most promising candidate to end the division and turmoil of Anugypt. That was the restorer of the Equestria Dynasty, the wise goddess of the desert, the queen accompanied by snakes, and the new pharaoh, Cleopatrot the Majesty.
Through schemes and marriages, Cleopatrot conquered many city-states in a few decades, becoming the queen of all ponies and jackals in the Anugypt desert with little use of force. Cleopatrot also knew that her beauty was her most powerful weapon, so she single-hoofedly pushed Anugypt's art and culture to unprecedented heights, and "fashion" became synonymous with that era.
No pony knows what happened later. There are rumors that the Sphinx once again destroyed the new dynasty as in history, and there are rumors that Cleopatrot's ambition made her the common enemy of the Anugypt desert, and some say her pursuit of fashion exhausted her country's wealth... In short, Cleopatrot failed to conquer the entire Anugypt, she was found dead from snake venom, and her dynasty split into countless small city-states, each with its own aesthetic school. Today, quite a few Anugypt city-states still claim to be descendants of this goddess and worship her bandage fashion, but some ponies suspect that Cleopatrot's death stemmed from a whimsical fashion attempt to use live snakes as mummy bandages.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_804]
南小马利亚王朝覆灭后，安及沙漠陷入了无尽的混乱与争斗之中。生活在这里的小马们眼见着一座座黄金铸造的城池在沙漠中崛起；又见它们在不到百年内倒塌在起义与叛乱中；那些反抗者与他们的统治者一同化为沙漠中的一抔黄土；幸存者则随着追随着沙丘的涟漪寻找新的绿洲，直到他们被狂风抹去足迹，或是竖起下一代的高城。在安及诸城邦的混战中，曾有过一位美丽而雄心勃勃的天马，曾是结束安及分裂与动乱的最有力候选。她就是小马利亚王朝的复兴者，沙漠中的智慧女神，与蛇相伴的女王，新法老，克骊欧佩特拉殿下。
通过计谋与联姻，几十年间克骊欧佩特拉征服了诸多城邦，她几乎不费多少武力就成为了安及沙漠中所有天马与豺狼的女王。克骊欧佩特拉也十分清楚她的美貌是她最强大的武器，因此她也以一己之力将安及的艺术与文化推向了前所未有的高度，“时尚”成为了那个时代的代名词。
没有小马知道后来发生了什么，有传言说斯芬克斯再一次如历史上一样毁灭了新王朝，也有传言说克骊欧佩特拉的野心让她成为了安及沙漠的共同死敌，还有说她对时尚的追求耗尽了她国家的财富... 总之，克骊欧佩特拉未能征服整个安及，她被发现死于蛇毒，她的王朝也随之分裂为无数的小城邦，有着各自的美学流派。如今，相当多的安及城邦依然自称为这位女神的后嗣，并信奉她绷带时尚学，但也有小马怀疑克骊欧佩特拉的死亡就源自于一次异想天开的用活蛇当木乃伊绷带的时尚尝试。
